msgid "晶格随机扰动（Lattice Perturb）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:5
#: 9f1dfaa88b31491796384014ce84a343
msgid "**分类：** 晶格"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:7
#: ed841de3e1f74c4793e0576129e2138f
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:9
#: 0b021731e3dd4163b308d2366c1a0d88
msgid ""
"对晶胞尺度和角度做轻量随机扰动，为近平衡态补充几何变化样本。每个输出结构在原"
"始晶格基础上引入独立随机的长度缩放和（可选的）角度缩放。"
msgstr ""
"Apply small random changes to cell lengths and, optionally, cell angles to "
"sample geometry near equilibrium. Every output receives an independent "
"perturbation of the original lattice."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:11
#: 2071eb2337fa4d12abe9bfe78c59037c
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:13
#: 4c5e6490bb2a405787f972e6f8c6525b
msgid "f_k\\in[1-m,1+m],\\quad a_i'=f_i a_i,\\quad \\theta_j'=g_j\\theta_j"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:15
#: db2f70197f1043af8db646601e4f10b9
msgid ""
"其中 $m$ 是最大相对缩放，$f_i$ 是第 $i$ 条晶格矢量的随机长度因子；开启角度扰"
"动时 $g_j$ 同样在指定范围内抽样并作用于晶格角。原子分数坐标保持不变，因此 "
"Cartesian 坐标 会随新晶胞同步变化。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:19
#: 68f6f4d674504a9fbc2207d463a5bb2d
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:21
#: dccdf67ec73341259164519f8e440bae
msgid "场景：模型预测热膨胀系数偏差超过 30%"
msgstr "Scenario: Thermal expansion is wrong by more than 30%"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:23
#: e65da08fcc844984b0f419ce19f11fc6
msgid ""
"你在 Si 上训练了一个 NEP 模型，弛豫态的能量和力精度都过关，但用准谐近似算出来"
"的热膨胀系数比实验值大了 30%。诊断发现：训练集里所有结构都处在同一平衡体积，"
"模型对体积轻微变化时的能量梯度完全是外推出来的——外推不准。"
msgstr ""
"A Si NEP has acceptable energy and force errors at relaxed structures, yet a "
"quasiharmonic calculation overestimates thermal expansion by 30%. Every "
"training structure has the same equilibrium volume, so energy gradients "
"under small volume changes are extrapolated."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:25
#: 00274edde6cd49f5840e0c43db9d4f2b
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 热膨胀系数取决于声子频率对体积的导数，归根结底需要模型在平衡体"
"积附近有足够的体积-能量采样点。纯静态弛豫结构只有一个体积，不够。解决办法是围"
"绕平衡晶格随机生成一批稍微膨胀或收缩的结构，用少量白噪声覆盖近邻体积空间。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** Thermal expansion depends on volume derivatives of phonon "
"frequencies, which requires adequate volume-energy sampling around "
"equilibrium. A single relaxed volume is insufficient. Add modest random "
"contractions and expansions around the equilibrium lattice to cover the "
"nearby cell space."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:27
#: 12977e6ecb4447318014a56b19b9bb49
msgid "**输入：** 一个弛豫好的 Si 单胞"
msgstr "**Input:** A relaxed Si unit cell."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:29
#: 2c655c5958d94bc992dd0b0b5c0c0271
msgid ""
"**目标：** 围绕平衡体积生成 30 个随机晶格扰动的结构，缩放幅度 4%，覆盖 ±4% 的"
"体积范围"
msgstr ""
"**Objective:** Generate 30 random lattice variants around equilibrium with a "
"4% scaling amplitude."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:31
#: 26c1207e8f5a4d9f90e62297bf4c9341
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:32
#: fec377c1e5734410a007e025dc7d2f50
msgid "`最大缩放`（`max_scaling`） = `0.04` （4% 缩放幅度）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:33
#: 3e104c52902647599281af4196ebf0c4
msgid "`最大输出数量`（`max_num`） = `30`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:34
#: c170e3e9363147d88cd5b13896bc1a78
msgid ""
"`扰动角度`（`perturb_angle`） = `false` （先只看长度变化，避免角度扰动混入）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:36
#: 6b2c9263ea564a9f833bf7728720e9ef
msgid ""
"**输出：** 30 个结构，每个的晶格长度在原始值的 96%~104% 之间随机分布，原子分"
"数坐标随晶格同步缩放"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** Thirty structures whose lattice lengths are sampled between 96% "
"and 104% of the input values, with atoms following the cell at fixed "
"fractional coordinates."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:38
#: ce5937a3c0a943a3803a63929dd64675
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:39
#: 6fefaa88167246ed8e94108b27513166
msgid "重训后重新跑准谐近似计算热膨胀系数，应更接近实验值"
msgstr ""
"After retraining, repeat the quasiharmonic calculation; thermal expansion "
"should move closer to experiment."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:40
#: 431fabc20ad3403a83fe599a9df04179
msgid ""
"检查输出结构的体积分布直方图：应均匀覆盖 [V*(1-0.04), V*(1+0.04)]，不要在两端"
"堆积"
msgstr ""
"Inspect the output volume histogram. It should cover the intended "
"neighborhood without strong endpoint clustering."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:41
#: 0f326e24ab70445d8a8f0edceb9fa0a4
msgid ""
"如果改善不够，增大 `最大缩放`（`max_scaling`）到 0.06~0.08，同时换 Sobol 引擎"
"覆盖更均匀"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:42
#: edbcf746229c47c2b39c05e1880fd373
msgid ""
"抽查最短键长：如果 4% 缩放后最短键比 DFT 参考键长短了 > 0.2 Å，说明缩放过大，"
"回调 `最大缩放`（`max_scaling`）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:44
#: 27d5bce1f2154c898aec6ddbf0215cff
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:46
#: ed05ec200d784466ad1a922e5955a2e0
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:47
#: 57bc8ec95efc4693b3b4046ce7b7e087
msgid "模型对体积变化敏感，体积-能量曲线或热膨胀相关性质偏差大"
msgstr ""
"Volume-sensitive predictions, the volume-energy curve, or thermal-expansion "
"properties are inaccurate"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:48
#: 756d18e724c341c2b64bd298f174228b
msgid "训练集中所有结构体积过于集中，缺少近平衡体积散布"
msgstr ""
"Training volumes are concentrated at one value with no near-equilibrium "
"spread"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:49
#: 2eafde9ef0e144c39c9751fcdef591fc
msgid "需要模型在 ±5% 体积范围内有内插能力"
msgstr "The model needs interpolation coverage over modest volume changes"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:51
#: f1cf608f00914536b7076cea023fcf8e
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:52
#: 1b8586c8827e4ac1ad6792d86ffb1515
msgid "只需要特定方向、特定幅度的应变 → 用 `Lattice Strain` 更精确控制"
msgstr ""
"A specific direction and strain magnitude are required; use `Lattice Strain` "
"for controlled scanning"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:53
#: 951fdab871e0406594cd1b7363496cd1
msgid "体系本身刚度极大、体积变化无物理意义（如高压相），扰动只产生无意义结构"
msgstr ""
"Volume changes are outside the intended physical regime, for example a "
"tightly constrained high-pressure phase"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:54
#: d8ada78fd66b4c648d58c0e571665351
msgid ""
"输入结构含有机分子但没开 `识别有机分子`（`identify_organic`） —— 分子内键会被"
"错误拉伸"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:56
#: 3090639d3e88428b849effcd8a3bd13c
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:58
#: 9d8f398e256f44d683d59971b3995ac8
msgid "生成方式（engine_type）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:60
#: af3f53dde6c74c51bf637e169605ec55
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 1。`0` = Sobol 准随机序列，`1` = Uniform 均匀随机。Sobol 在少量样"
"本（< 20）时覆盖明显更均匀，Uniform 则生成更快。样本数上到 50 以后两者差异很"
"小，选哪个都行。如果你只跑十几个结构，优先 Sobol。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `1`. `0` selects a Sobol low-discrepancy sequence and `1` "
"uniform random sampling. Sobol gives more even coverage for fewer than about "
"20 samples; uniform sampling is simpler and differences diminish around 50 "
"samples. Prefer Sobol for a small design."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:62
#: 2999033298b5462aa413ffc99c75dda5
msgid "最大缩放（max_scaling）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:64
#: 57bb684ac72e4f5dbe880ed14fa48f0a
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `0.04`。晶格长度的随机缩放幅度系数 `m`，实际长度会在 `[1-m, "
"1+m]` 范围内均匀采样。如果同时开启了 `扰动角度`（`perturb_angle`），角度也在"
"这个相对范围内同步缩放。0.01~0.03 适合补近平衡声子区；推到 0.04~0.06 覆盖热膨"
"胀；设到 0.08 以上时务必抽查最近邻距离，防止出现非物理键长。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:66
#: 491de6b418cb47588a0043f187b93f0d
msgid "最大输出数量（max_num）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:68
#: 66d37bed3096446094f5c887263ffdeb
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 50。每个输入结构生成多少个扰动版本。注意这不是晶格方向数——是输出"
"结构的数量。20~30 个足够覆盖 ±4% 体积空间的 3D 长度自由度；50~100 个适用于同"
"时扰动角度的 6D 空间。这里是随机采样而不是系统网格，增大这个值提高的是覆盖密"
"度，不是覆盖范围。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `50`. Number of perturbed outputs per input, not the number "
"of lattice directions. Roughly 20-30 samples can cover three length degrees "
"of freedom at modest amplitude; 50-100 are more appropriate when angles "
"expand the space to six dimensions. Increasing the count raises density, not "
"range."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:70
#: 9b617ff634624e93820168b6f2bde9a5
msgid "扰动角度（perturb_angle）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:72
#: 2cf1fe3dbe3b47dab0ef0b340867f3b3
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `true`。打开后晶格角度（alpha/beta/gamma）也跟着一起随机缩放——注"
"意这是乘性缩放（原始角度乘以一个随机因子），不是加性偏移。非正交晶格体系（单"
"斜、三斜）建议保持打开；正交或更高对称的晶系可以先关掉，长度覆盖够用以后再"
"开。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `true`. Randomly scale alpha, beta, and gamma as well as "
"lengths. This is multiplicative, not an additive angular offset. It is "
"useful for monoclinic or triclinic cells; for orthogonal or higher-symmetry "
"cells, begin with it disabled and add angle coverage only when needed."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:74
#: e82ab5e0343843c089ece7a6638b47c0
msgid "识别有机分子（identify_organic）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:76
#: 5b0fcaba02bb4745ad5e6d23393c7102
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `false`。打开后程序识别有机分子团簇，扰动时团簇做刚性整体移动，"
"分子内键长不参与缩放。分子晶体（MOF、有机半导体）必须开，否则晶格缩放会直接把"
"分子内键拉断。纯无机体系关着省计算。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. Detect molecular clusters and move each "
"approximately as a rigid body so intramolecular bonds are not scaled. Enable "
"for molecular crystals, MOFs, and organic semiconductors; leave disabled for "
"purely inorganic systems."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:78
#: 4bfadf9c276e4281ae45826c862cdcfe
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:80
#: ee937a98bd034387883cec1626d5081d
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `false`。打开后每次同一输入 + 同一参数 + 同一 seed 得到完全相同"
"的扰动结果。做对比实验或需要复现的时候打开，纯探索阶段可以关着。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. Enable to reproduce perturbations from the same "
"input, parameters, and seed. Use it for controlled comparisons; exploratory "
"generation may leave it disabled."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:82
#: 69a1f67085644fdfb381c2ef743dab86
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:84
#: dd9080c304034a098e7cd4930e2cc19d
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 0。随机种子值，仅在 `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`）打开时生效。两个"
"不同的 seed 会产生两组不同的扰动分布。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:86
#: e4c03d25d82a4f9091ace0027694f0ac
msgid "生效条件：`use_seed=True`。"
msgstr "Active only when `use_seed=True`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:88
#: 88d328be2570445bada26673d4839b44
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:90
#: 5c7339cf4cb84e1daedfe1623d097230
msgid "近平衡声子覆盖（max_scaling=2%，仅长度，Sobol）"
msgstr "Near-equilibrium phonon coverage (2% length-only scaling with Sobol)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:91
#: 9560a19df3ce4e6fa05bde5266769dbf
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CellScalingCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"engine_type\": 0,\n"
"    \"max_scaling\": 0.02,\n"
"    \"max_num\": 30,\n"
"    \"perturb_angle\": false,\n"
"    \"identify_organic\": false,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:107
#: 537b15609e5f41f0ba8da645c09d24d2
msgid "热膨胀 + 角度覆盖（max_scaling=5%，长度+角度，50 样本）"
msgstr ""
"Thermal expansion plus angle coverage (5%, lengths and angles, 50 samples)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:108
#: 203893af8bf141218cae70946313dbdb
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CellScalingCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"engine_type\": 1,\n"
"    \"max_scaling\": 0.05,\n"
"    \"max_num\": 50,\n"
"    \"perturb_angle\": true,\n"
"    \"identify_organic\": false,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:124
#: 4b5a82b410f7410c9f7b5624cdbc4172
msgid "大范围探索（max_scaling=8%，100 样本，含有机保护）"
msgstr "Broad exploration (8%, 100 samples, molecular protection enabled)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:125
#: 409958401ff14780a0bb1de7523c5a84
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CellScalingCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"engine_type\": 0,\n"
"    \"max_scaling\": 0.08,\n"
"    \"max_num\": 100,\n"
"    \"perturb_angle\": true,\n"
"    \"identify_organic\": true,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:141
#: 9a44a7f35d1b4a10a904f1582c905c1d
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:143
#: 1e21edb90d5b40f68400d5aff2badbc7
msgid ""
"`Lattice Strain` → `Lattice Perturb`：先系统扫特定方向应变，再补充随机近邻散"
"布"
msgstr ""
"`Lattice Strain` -> `Lattice Perturb`: scan controlled directional strains, "
"then add random local coverage"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:144
#: a8d4f3ca5fa846e6ba8185be2ebe15e9
msgid "`Lattice Perturb` → `Atomic Perturb`：晶格扰动后再加原子级坐标噪声"
msgstr ""
"`Lattice Perturb` -> `Atomic Perturb`: perturb the cell before adding atom-"
"level coordinate noise"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:145
#: 47b4424d52cc44ce80be3a38d2889c02
msgid "`Super Cell` → `Lattice Perturb`：扩胞后在更大尺度上做晶格扰动"
msgstr ""
"`Super Cell` -> `Lattice Perturb`: expand the structure before perturbing "
"its cell"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:147
#: 7382e96552b64e12a62736366bfee1fd
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:149
#: 922884f4e5bf4caba5f2dcec83e489ea
msgid ""
"**输出全是相同结构或分布极窄。** `最大缩放`（`max_scaling`）是否太小（如 "
"0.001）？或者 `最大输出数量`（`max_num`）太小导致偶然均匀。先增大 `最大缩放`"
"（`max_scaling`）到 0.02 以上，增大 `最大输出数量`（`max_num`）到 20 以上。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:151
#: 44d7fc03ae4b4867b6ff6292cc854e8b
msgid ""
"**分子晶体输出中键被拉断。** `识别有机分子`（`identify_organic`）没开。对于 "
"MOF、有机晶体等，必须开启此开关，否则晶格缩放会直接拉伸分子内键。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:153
#: 51d80899c32e4243aeeacd54f9410f8a
msgid ""
"**角度扰动后结构角度变化不符合预期。** 注意此卡的角度扰动是乘性缩放（原始角度"
"乘以随机因子），不是加性偏移。如果原始角度是 90 度、`max_scaling=0.04`，新角"
"度在 86.4~93.6 度之间。"
msgstr ""
"**Angle changes differ from expectation.** The card multiplies each angle by "
"a random factor rather than adding an offset. At 90 degrees with "
"`max_scaling=0.04`, the range is 86.4-93.6 degrees."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:155
#: 393599cb993c43fabf8e769ead808501
msgid ""
"**Sobol 和 Uniform 输出差异大。** `最大输出数量`（`max_num`）较小时（< 20）"
"Sobol 覆盖明显更均匀。样本数 ≥ 50 后两者差异缩小。如果在意复现性，固定 `生成"
"方式`（`engine_type`） + `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:157
#: d5edafd517f74043960e21fb7ba5c5ff
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:159
#: aaae62363ad7482fa9e4dccd3ca393bb
msgid "`LSc(max={max_scaling},{U|S})` —— `U` 表示 Uniform，`S` 表示 Sobol。"
msgstr ""
"`LSc(max={max_scaling},{U|S})`, where `U` means uniform and `S` means Sobol."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:161
#: 31fe29ec9c3f4c58b7d32f250e4cba6b
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/cell-scaling-card.md:163
#: 925958047e224af0919cad897e0d91e9
msgid ""
"勾选 `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`） + 固定 `随机种子`（`seed`） → 相同输入可复"
"现。seed 会与单帧结构内容共同派生，因此几何或晶胞不同的帧不会机械复用同一组缩"
"放因子，数据集重新排序也不改变单帧结果；完全相同的重复帧仍得到相同结果。"
"Sobol 引擎的 scramble 同样受这个派生 seed 控制。"
msgstr ""

#~ msgid "晶格扰动（Lattice Perturb）"
#~ msgstr "Lattice Perturb"

#~ msgid "`max_scaling` = `0.04` （4% 缩放幅度）"
#~ msgstr "`max_scaling` = `0.04` (4% scaling amplitude)"

#~ msgid "`perturb_angle` = `false` （先只看长度变化，避免角度扰动混入）"
#~ msgstr "`perturb_angle` = `false` (isolate length changes first)"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "如果改善不够，增大 `max_scaling` 到 0.06~0.08，同时换 Sobol 引擎覆盖更均匀"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If coverage remains insufficient, increase `max_scaling` toward 0.06-0.08 "
#~ "and consider the Sobol engine for a more even small-sample design."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "抽查最短键长：如果 4% 缩放后最短键比 DFT 参考键长短了 > 0.2 Å，说明缩放过"
#~ "大，回调 `max_scaling`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Spot-check nearest-neighbor distances. If a 4% perturbation shortens a "
#~ "bond by more than 0.2 Å relative to the DFT reference, reduce "
#~ "`max_scaling`."

#~ msgid "输入结构含有机分子但没开 `identify_organic` —— 分子内键会被错误拉伸"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The input contains molecules but `identify_organic` is disabled, which "
#~ "would distort intramolecular bonds"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 `0.04`。晶格长度的随机缩放幅度系数 `m`，实际长度会在 `[1-m, "
#~ "1+m]` 范围内均匀采样。如果同时开启了 `perturb_angle`，角度也在这个相对范围"
#~ "内同步缩放。0.01~0.03 适合补近平衡声子区；推到 0.04~0.06 覆盖热膨胀；设到 "
#~ "0.08 以上时务必抽查最近邻距离，防止出现非物理键长。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `0.04`. Lattice lengths are sampled with factors in `[1-"
#~ "m, 1+m]`. With `perturb_angle`, angles receive the same relative scaling. "
#~ "Values around 0.01-0.03 target near-equilibrium phonon sampling, while "
#~ "0.04-0.06 broadens thermal-expansion coverage. Above 0.08, inspect "
#~ "nearest-neighbor distances for nonphysical bonds."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 0。随机种子值，仅在 `use_seed` 打开时生效。两个不同的 seed 会"
#~ "产生两组不同的扰动分布。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default `0`. Random seed used only when `use_seed` is enabled. "
#~ "Different seeds produce different perturbation designs."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出全是相同结构或分布极窄。** `max_scaling` 是否太小（如 0.001）？或者 "
#~ "`max_num` 太小导致偶然均匀。先增大 `max_scaling` 到 0.02 以上，增大 "
#~ "`max_num` 到 20 以上。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Outputs are identical or cover an extremely narrow range.** Check "
#~ "whether `max_scaling` or `max_num` is too small. As a diagnostic, try "
#~ "`max_scaling` of at least 0.02 and `max_num` of at least 20."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**分子晶体输出中键被拉断。** `identify_organic` 没开。对于 MOF、有机晶体"
#~ "等，必须开启此开关，否则晶格缩放会直接拉伸分子内键。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Bonds break in a molecular crystal.** Enable `identify_organic`; "
#~ "otherwise cell scaling directly distorts intramolecular geometry."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Sobol 和 Uniform 输出差异大。** `max_num` 较小时（< 20）Sobol 覆盖明显更"
#~ "均匀。样本数 ≥ 50 后两者差异缩小。如果在意复现性，固定 `engine_type` + "
#~ "`use_seed`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Sobol and uniform outputs differ strongly.** This is expected for fewer "
#~ "than about 20 samples, where Sobol is more even. Differences shrink "
#~ "around 50 samples. For reproducibility, fix both `engine_type` and the "
#~ "seed."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "勾选 `use_seed` + 固定 `seed` → 相同输入可复现。seed 会与单帧结构内容共同"
#~ "派生，因此几何或晶胞不同的帧不会机械复用同一组缩放因子，数据集重新排序也不"
#~ "改变单帧结果；完全相同的重复帧仍得到相同结果。Sobol 引擎的 scramble 同样受"
#~ "这个派生 seed 控制。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Enable `use_seed` and fix `seed` to reproduce an input. The seed is "
#~ "combined with each structure's content, so frames with different geometry "
#~ "or cells do not reuse the same scale factors, and reordering the dataset "
#~ "does not change a frame's result. Exactly duplicated frames still receive "
#~ "identical results. The derived seed also controls Sobol scrambling."
